00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.630
or the virtual private cloud.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.005
I'm going to talk
about a concept

00:01:17.005 --> 00:01:18.902
that Google has done
called shared VPC.

00:01:18.902 --> 00:01:21.360
And I'm also going to talk
about once you build these VPCs,

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.940
how do you actually connect to
them from your on-prem or data

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.410
center locations.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:29.430
During the next section, we'll
cover routing or VPC peering.

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:31.776
Next, we'll move into
